{
 "id": "arc-the-shoot-at-mums",
 "title": "A candid shoot",
 "owner": "sponsor",
 "summary": "The boot sponsor wants a \"candid\" photo shoot at your mum's house. Weeks later Mum gets an offer of her own, or asks why you kept her out. A season on the photos are on a billboard, and a season after that the boot deal is up and Mum has opinions.",
 "size": "small",
 "about": {
